<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; mso-line-height-alt: NaNpx;"></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">Payment is due by {$job.due_date|date_format:"%d/%m/%Y"} as per our terms. </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">Access your invoices on your </span><a href="https://www.idal.co/invoices" style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;" target="_blank" title="Payments"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">Payments</span></a><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;"> page. Your due amount is inclusive of iDAL’s commission fee (10% plus VAT unless otherwise stated).</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">You can pay online using a credit or a debit card. If you wish to pay by invoice kindly request this function from </span><a href="mailto:support@idal.co" style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;" target="_blank" title="support@idal.co"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">support@idal.co</span></a><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; mso-line-height-alt: NaNpx;"></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">To speed up the process, you will be able to pay immediately after the project is confirmed. The amount will only be released the day after the project is done. Please rate the model(s) to finalise the payment. Kindly note that iDAL uses a third-party payment system and does not hold any monies payable to models for jobs. </span></p>
</div>
